Creative and educational game for children that will help your child spend time with an electronic device effectively. Let your child feel like a real artist. The app includes coloring activity which is friendly to the youngest as well as drawing lessons intended to develop fine motor skills. Also, the app contains pictures on different topics which will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny characters. The following is waiting for you:

- 9 topic packs with 135 pages;
- Easy coloring for children;
- Drawing lessons;
- Creativity development.

The app is designed for children of preschool age and also suitable for boys and girls 2- 4 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational elements as developing of fine motor skills and logic. Have fun!

Bimi Boo with you again! This time you will go to visit friends of Bimi Boo, who live in a treehouse. You will meet a sly cat, funny rabbit and cute squirrel. There is an exciting game in the house of your baby in which he can help to bring order, to place everything in its place and feed friends of Bimi Boo.

15 different games will fascinate a child with not only bright colors and funny animations, but also with interesting and clear tasks such as:

- Arrange items by color, shape, number and size;
- Pick up items within the meaning of;
- Arrange the geometric shapes according to silhouette;
- Sort items in its place
- Feed animals in a right way;
- Restore pictures from memory.

Together with Bimi Boo Shapes & Colors, your baby will learn to distinguish shapes, colors, texture and quantity. The game also improves fine motor skills, attention and intelligence. It contains everything you need for a fun and healthy development of the child.

Effective application for learning irregular verbs in English! 
187 irregular verbs sounded in England, original illustrations, excellent simulators, tracking of training progress and even a game, allowing learned material reinforcement.
Our application will help English language learners to cope easily with the topic Irregular verbs.
The unique memorizing technique will help to learn English irregular verbs quickly and without major problems.
Many popular online services like: duolingo, bright, lingualeo, aword, skyeng, busuu, puzzle english help to learn English from scratch, but they don't focus on irregular verbs.
Advantages of the application:
• It is easy to learn and conveniently to repeat English irregular verbs without extra-efforts and cramming;
• All English verbs are sounded in England by native speaker, it will help to improve your pronunciation;
• Original illustrations will facilitate learner to memorize a verb quickly;
• You can make own lists of English irregular verbs, highlighting it with different colors;
• You can find flash-cards of fast repetition within this application.
We wish you pleasant training!

Educational games for children which will help your baby spend his time with an electronic device effectively. You will visit Bimi Boo’s friends who live on a wondrous island. You will play developing games with a kittens, funny birds and cute squirrel.

The application includes simple games intended to develop fine motor skills and that will entertain your child with bright colors, nice characters and interesting tasks:

- Arrange object by color, form, number and size;
- Use logic when selecting series of items;
- Put geometrical figures on the silhouette;
- Sort things in the right order;
- Restore pictures from memory.

Designed for children of preschool age and also suitable for boys and girls 2- 5 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational elements as puzzles, sorting and logical games.

The application contains the following developing and educative games for children:

- Items sorting – you need to put food into the fridge and clothes into the wardrobe;
- Logic tasks in the game with a train – help cute kittens get home and deliver food for them;
- Thinking activities where your kid will arrange items in the baskets;
- Logical thinking tasks where your child will sort things by their features.

Welcome to Baby Panda's Chinese Recipes! This is a cooking game about Chinese cuisine where you can cook various Chinese dishes according to the recipes, and become a good Chinese food chef as you explore and learn! Are you ready? Let's start cooking!

VARIOUS RECIPES
You will find 11 kinds of Chinese food in this cooking game. Apart from staples like noodles and steamed buns, there are also specialties such as Peking duck and Mapo tofu. Now, festive food like sweet rice dumplings and Zongzi are also available for you to explore and cook!

EASY TO COOK
In this cooking game, you are provided with a detailed recipe for each dish. Following Baby Panda's cooking tips, you can chop, fry, deep-fry and cook delicious Chinese dishes with just a few moves of your finger! Come and try it out!

LOVELY CUSTOMERS
Customers will give you surprising responses! It could be their happy face when they eat something delicious, or their fire-breathing mouth when they eat something spicy! Watch their reactions, find out what they like, and cook more dishes that they like!

In this cooking game, you can not only learn about Chinese recipes, but also gain knowledge about traditional Chinese food! Join us and discover Chinese recipes now!

FEATURES:
- Various recipes: 11 special Chinese dishes, such as dumplings and noodles;
- Diverse ingredients: 30+ ingredients, such as apples, mushrooms and lobsters;
- 6 ways of cooking: frying, boiling, stir-frying, instant boiling and more;
- Kid-friendly designs: simple operation and step-by step instructions;
- Customized food: make different flavors based on customers' preferences;
- Support offline play: play offline anytime and anywhere!
